            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "8bbd4fa3-d3cf-4ff4-bd96-65dc852e508b",
               "text": "Texto Original",
               "page": "https://www.historytracers.org/index.html?page=class_content&arg=8bbd4fa3-d3cf-4ff4-bd96-65dc852e508b",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2026",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Como Você\n\nObserve as mãos abaixo: elas não são a única parte do nosso corpo que temos duplicada.\n\nTemos duas mãos, dois pés, dois olhos e duas orelhas — nosso corpo está cheio de pares! Cada mão tem 5 dedos, e temos duas mãos, então nossos dedos formam dois grupos de 5: 5 + 5 = 10.\n\nPares como esses são exatamente do que trata multiplicar por dois: pegar um número e dobrá-lo, um par por vez.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 200\"><g transform=\"translate(300,-19) scale(0.6)\"><g id=\"leftHand\"><path class=\"hand-shape\" fill=\"#F4C2A1\"  d=\"M-268.1,338l21.7-21.7c2.3-2.3,3.5-5.3,3.5-8.5v-55.7c0-5.6,2.2-10.9,6.2-14.9l32.4-32.4 c2.1-2.1,5.8-1.8,7.4,0.8c2.8,4.4,5,11.4-1.4,18.9c-5.1,5.9-10.3,10.9-13.7,14.1 c-2.2,2-2.2,5.4-0.1,7.5c2,2,5.3,2,7.3,0l87.6-87.6c4.6-4.6,12.2-4.6,16.8,0 c4.6,4.6,4.6,12.2,0,16.8l-66.2,66.2c-2.4,2.4-2.4,6.4,0,8.8  c2.4,2.4,6.4,2.4,8.8,0l74.5-75.3c4.6-4.7,12.2-4.7,16.9,0l1.8,1.8  c4.6,4.6,4.6,12.1,0.1,16.8l-70.4,71.3c-2.2,2.3-2.2,5.9,0,8.2 c2.3,2.3,5.9,2.3,8.2,0l61.2-61.2c4.6-4.6,12.2-4.6,16.8,0l0.2,0.2 c4.6,4.6,4.6,12.2,0,16.8l-67.1,67.1c-1.7,1.7-1.7,4.6,0,6.3 c1.7,1.7,4.6,1.7,6.3,0l50.7-50.7c3.9-3.9,10.1-3.9,13.9,0 c3.9,3.9,3.9,10.1,0,13.9l-98.2,98.2z\"/> </g> <g id=\"rightHand\" transform=\"scale(-1,1)\"> <path class=\"hand-shape\" fill=\"#F4C2A1\" d=\"M-268.1,338l21.7-21.7c2.3-2.3,3.5-5.3,3.5-8.5v-55.7c0-5.6,2.2-10.9,6.2-14.9l32.4-32.4 c2.1-2.1,5.8-1.8,7.4,0.8c2.8,4.4,5,11.4-1.4,18.9c-5.1,5.9-10.3,10.9-13.7,14.1 c-2.2,2-2.2,5.4-0.1,7.5c2,2,5.3,2,7.3,0l87.6-87.6c4.6-4.6,12.2-4.6,16.8,0 c4.6,4.6,4.6,12.2,0,16.8l-66.2,66.2c-2.4,2.4-2.4,6.4,0,8.8 c2.4,2.4,6.4,2.4,8.8,0l74.5-75.3c4.6-4.7,12.2-4.7,16.9,0l1.8,1.8 c4.6,4.6,4.6,12.1,0.1,16.8l-70.4,71.3c-2.2,2.3-2.2,5.9,0,8.2 c2.3,2.3,5.9,2.3,8.2,0l61.2-61.2c4.6-4.6,12.2-4.6,16.8,0l0.2,0.2 c4.6,4.6,4.6,12.2,0,16.8l-67.1,67.1c-1.7,1.7-1.7,4.6,0,6.3 c1.7,1.7,4.6,1.7,6.3,0l50.7-50.7c3.9-3.9,10.1-3.9,13.9,0 c3.9,3.9,3.9,10.1,0,13.9l-98.2,98.2z\"/> </g> </svg>",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "Duas mãos abertas, com os dedos abertos.",
